\section{Results}\label{results}

All counts in this section are as recorded in the tracks' evidence files
and in the team's consolidated results; we did not re-run any test or
launch either application. Fig.~\ref{fig-acc} summarises the
acceptance outcomes.

\begin{figure}
\centering
\pandocbounded{\includegraphics[keepaspectratio,alt={Parent acceptance
criteria passed. Base (op.): baseline, operator report, of 19. Base
(ind.): baseline, independent evaluator, of 19 (Spec Kit also had one
Blocked). CR-01: of 22. Regress.: baseline re-check after CR-01, of
19.}]{figures/acceptance-outcomes.png}}
\caption{Parent acceptance criteria passed. Base (op.): baseline,
operator report, of 19. Base (ind.): baseline, independent evaluator, of
